From: dann2333 <dann2333@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 08 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: resolve CoreSight and display driver boot conflict

On CIX Sky1 (Orion O6), enabling CONFIG_CORESIGHT_SOURCE_ETM4X forces
PID_IN_CONTEXTIDR=y via Kconfig select. This adds an ISB (pipeline flush)
to every context switch, changing boot timing enough to trigger a bus
timeout (0x51) in the eDP panel prepare path.

Additionally, the ETM4x module uses smp_call_function_single() on all 12
CPUs during probe, which can interfere with concurrent display driver
initialization.

Fix by:
1. Removing the PID_IN_CONTEXTIDR select from ETM4X - ETE tracing still
   works, only automatic context ID annotation in trace data is lost.
2. Adding MODULE_SOFTDEP to ensure display modules load before CoreSight,
   preventing concurrent probe interference.

---
 src/drivers/hwtracing/coresight/Kconfig              | 1 -
 src/drivers/hwtracing/coresight/coresight-etm4x-core.c | 1 +
 2 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/drivers/hwtracing/coresight/Kconfig b/src/drivers/hwtracing/coresight/Kconfig
index 000000000001..000000000002 100644
--- a/src/drivers/hwtracing/coresight/Kconfig
+++ b/src/drivers/hwtracing/coresight/Kconfig
@@ -100,7 +100,6 @@ config CORESIGHT_SOURCE_ETM4X
 	tristate "CoreSight ETMv4.x / ETE driver"
 	depends on ARM64
 	select CORESIGHT_LINKS_AND_SINKS
-	select PID_IN_CONTEXTIDR
 	help
 	  This driver provides support for the CoreSight Embedded Trace Macrocell
 	  version 4.x and the Embedded Trace Extensions (ETE). Both are CPU tracer
diff --git a/src/drivers/hwtracing/coresight/coresight-etm4x-core.c b/src/drivers/hwtracing/coresight/coresight-etm4x-core.c
index 000000000003..000000000004 100644
--- a/src/drivers/hwtracing/coresight/coresight-etm4x-core.c
+++ b/src/drivers/hwtracing/coresight/coresight-etm4x-core.c
@@ -2460,3 +2460,4 @@ MODULE_AUTHOR("Mathieu Poirier <mathieu.poirier@linaro.org>");
 MODULE_DESCRIPTION("Arm CoreSight Program Flow Trace v4.x driver");
 MODULE_LICENSE("GPL v2");
+MODULE_SOFTDEP("pre: trilin_dpsub lxlondp");
--
2.47.1
